    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone's infected, and the only option is the nuclear one. Can you escape the town, before it comes to that? Or will you succumb to the virus? Explore the town of Little River, while trying to find a way out. You might not figure out the mystery of the outbreak, but you might just escape with your life.  Every bite feeds the infection, every second the virus spreads. A message is broadcast on every channel to take shelter immediately. But that only means one thing. You must escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic-style survival horror game, with online functionality. Try to escape with up to three friends. Fixed cameras, zombies, and plenty to explore.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone's infected, and the only option is the nuclear one. Can you escape the town, before it comes to that? Or will you succumb to the virus? Explore the town of Little River, while trying to find a way out. You might not figure out the mystery of the outbreak, but you might just escape with your life.  Every bite feeds the infection, every second the virus spreads. A message is broadcast on every channel to take shelter immediately. But that only means one thing. You must escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic-style survival horror game, with online functionality. Try to escape with up to three friends. Fixed cameras, zombies, and plenty to explore.</p>",
    "short_description": "You must escape the town, while trying to beat 2 clocks. An incoming nuke, and a viral infection. Can you make it out in time?",
